OL,3,AAt least 12 killed after war-damaged
OL,4,AGaza building collapses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed,
OL,7,Fincluding children, and dozens are
OL,8,Fmissing after a war-damaged building
OL,9,Fcollapsed in the Gaza Strip, according
OL,10,Fto local rescue teams.
OL,12,FVideo footage shows the search for
OL,13,Fbodies and survivors continuing in the
OL,14,Frubble of the multi-storey building in
OL,15,Fthe Tal al-Hawa area of Gaza City, its
OL,16,Ffloors sandwiched together.
OL,18,FLocals said 10 families had been living
OL,19,Fin the apartments despite warnings that
OL,20,Fthey were unsafe.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
